      </item>
      <item>
        <title>We support this petition, signed by our CEO, several co-founders, and senior staff. Our own research on recursive self-improvement, published last month, points to the need for tools to deliberately pace the frontier of AI development so society can prepare. We’re glad to see broad agreement across the field. https://www.pacingthefrontier.com/</title>
        <dc:creator>@AnthropicAI</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>We support this petition, signed by our CEO, several co-founders, and senior staff. <br>
<br>
Our own research on recursive self-improvement, published last month, points to the need for tools to deliberately pace the frontier of AI development so society can prepare. We’re glad to see broad agreement across the field. <a href="https://www.pacingthefrontier.com/">pacingthefrontier.com/</a></p>
<hr/>
<b>Link</b><br>
<a href="https://www.pacingthefrontier.com/">
