      <item>
        <title>R to @AnthropicAI: We also worked with academics at ETH Zurich, Tel Aviv University, and the University of Haifa to build CryptanalysisBench, a benchmark for studying LLMs’ cryptanalysis abilities. https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.18538</title>
        <dc:creator>@AnthropicAI</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>We also worked with academics at ETH Zurich, Tel Aviv University, and the University of Haifa to build CryptanalysisBench, a benchmark for studying LLMs’ cryptanalysis abilities.<br>
<br>
<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.18538">arxiv.org/abs/2607.18538</a></p>
<hr/>
<b>Link</b><br>
<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.18538">
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/card_img%2F2081932888870674432%2Fzo6pSyya%3Fformat%3Djpg%26name%3D420x420_2" style="max-width:250px;" />
<br>
<b>CryptanalysisBench: Can LLMs do Cryptanalysis?</b>
</a>
<p>Cryptanalysis - the task of finding attacks against cryptographic schemes - sits at the intersection of mathematical reasoning and cybersecurity, two areas where LLMs have advanced fastest....</p>
<small><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.18538">arxiv.org</a></small>]]></description>
