      <item>
        <title>RT by @AnthropicAI: You can now ask Claude about the Anthropic Economic Index, our public dataset measuring how AI is used across the economy. Ask which occupations use AI the most, or what kinds of tasks people are automating, and the answers draw directly from the Index data.</title>
        <dc:creator>@claudeai</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>You can now ask Claude about the Anthropic Economic Index, our public dataset measuring how AI is used across the economy.<br>
