      <item>
        <title>New Anthropic research: Agentic misalignment in Summer 2026. A year after our blackmail experiments, we found four more ways that today’s autonomous AI agents misbehave in simulations. Read more: https://alignment.anthropic.com/2026/agentic-misalignment-summer-2026/</title>
